              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_MQj8P4": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Maximize Endurance, Power, and Recovery with our Premier Nitric Oxide Supplement Stack",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_NTktwT": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>Unlock your ultimate athletic potential with the Power & Performance Stack the complete nitric oxide performance stack designed for dedicated athletes. This bundle combines our fast-acting Nitric Oxide Lozenges for immediate blood flow support with N.O. Beetz, our dual-fuel formula featuring PEAK ATP® for sustained cellular energy. It's the ultimate stimulant-free combination to boost endurance, power and recovery, all while supporting cardiovascular and brain health.<br/><br/></p><ul><li><strong>Sustain Peak Endurance:</strong>  Improve oxygen efficiency and push past your limits with superior blood flow to muscles.</li><li><strong>Amplify Power Output:</strong> Fuel explosive movements and all-out sprints with a direct source of cellular energy.</li><li><strong>Accelerate Post-Training Recovery:</strong> Enhance circulation to clear metabolic waste faster, so you can train harder, sooner.</li><li><strong>Superior \"Pump\" and Vascularity:</strong>For strength athletes, nitric oxide is the key to achieving enhanced muscle pump. This isn't just aesthetic; it signifies increased blood flow and nutrient delivery to the muscle cells, creating an optimal environment for performance and growth.</li><li><strong>Support Cardiovascular and Cognitive Health:</strong> Optimize blood flow for a healthy heart and maintain brain function for sharper focus during training.</li><li><strong>Boost Immune Health: </strong>Strengthen your body’s defenses with enhanced circulation, delivering vital nutrients and oxygen to support a resilient immune system.</li></ul>",
