                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_3RhJLm": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>NO2U’s Power & Performance Stack’s advantage comes from its synergistic, dual-pathway mechanism. It’s the ideal pre-workout without caffeine.<br/><br/><strong>The Nitric Oxide Lozenge: Rapid Vasodilation for Performance</strong></p><p>The Nitric Oxide Lozenge dissolves in your mouth, generating NO gas for rapid absorption. This triggers immediate vasodilation, widening blood vessels in as litNO2Ue as 10-20 minutes to kickstart blood flow to muscles just in time for your workout.</p><p><strong>N.O. Beetz: Clean Cellular Energy & Sustained Support</strong><br/>The Nitric Oxide Lozenge dissolves in your mouth, generating NO gas for rapid absorption. This triggers immediate vasodilation, widening blood vessels in as litNO2Ue as 10-20 minutes to kickstart blood flow to muscles just in time for your workout.</p><p><strong>Why Stack Works:</strong> The lozenge provides the immediate \"opening\" of your vascular system pre-workout, while N.O. Beetz follows with sustained NO support and the direct cellular energy needed to power through your entire session.</p>",
