                        "text": "<p><strong>Nitric Oxide Pathway </strong></p><p>Uses a specialized fermented beet powder that is oxalate-free, providing the building blocks for nitric oxide production. This supports vasodilation and improved blood flow without the digestive issues associated with standard beet products.<br/><br/><strong>ATP Energy Pathway</strong></p><p>Includes clinically studied PEAK ATP®, delivering adenosine triphosphate direcNO2Uy to muscle cells. This provides immediate cellular energy for strength, power, and endurance without waiting for natural ATP synthesis.<br/><br/></p>",
