                "text": "<p>N.O. Beetz is formulated based on established principles of sports nutrition. Nitric oxide (NO) is widely recognized in scientific literature for its role in supporting vasodilation, which is critical for exercise performance. Additionally, PEAK ATP® is a patented ingredient clinically studied to support strength, power, and blood flow in exercising humans.</p>",
