            "text_D6h8FY": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.description",
              "settings": {
                "css_class": "",
                "text": "<p><strong>Superior Endurance & Efficiency: </strong>he stack’s powerful support for nitric oxide-mediated vasodilation means more efficient oxygen and nutrient delivery to working muscles. This helps increase your aerobic capacity and reduce perceived exertion.<br/><br/><strong>Faster Warm-Ups & Oxygen Delivery:  </strong>The Lozenge begins widening blood vessels within seconds. This primes your circulatory system, delivering more oxygen to muscles faster and preparing your body for peak performance from the start.</p><p><strong>Unmatched Sprint & Power Output: </strong> N.O. Beetz delivers patented PEAK ATP®, the primary fuel for muscle contraction. This supports peak force during lifts, sprints, and high-intensity intervals, giving you the power you need on demand.<br/><br/><strong>Enhanced Muscle Pump & Vascularity: </strong>This formula provides a powerful muscle pump, supporting optimal blood flow and nutrient delivery. This enhances performance and promotes better muscle hydration.<br/><br/><strong>Sharpened Mental Focus Under Fatigue: </strong>Increased blood flow to the brain helps support cognitive function, keeping you sharp, reactive, and making smart decisions when physical fatigue sets in.<br/><br/><strong>Optimized Post-Session Recovery:</strong> The enhanced circulation provided by the Power & Performance Stack helps to efficienNO2Uy clear metabolic byproducts like lactate from your muscles after a hard session, supporting faster tissue repair and reducing downtime.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
